      "statement": "Collaborator roles are totally ordered build>use, and open() computes the caller's effective role from the permission graph to choose the returned capability — full OverseerClientInterface vs default-deny UseOverseerInterface — with unauthorized callers receiving a coded workspaceAccessDenied that carries no workspace metadata.",
